        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201c1MzUmlWbXc1VkRGUGVuUXlWMUIyY2tka2VVRRAB!2m1!1s0x34040115db4aac01:0xe36a65dcadcca9e9"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJAaxK2xUBBDQR6anMrdxlauM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tadk1rSmxiSGxUYWxOR1JtMVhjRFpYUlhZNFoxRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "酒吧主打清酒，但都有其他日本酒例如威士忌。老闆對各種清酒非常熟悉，食客如果唔熟清酒，老闆會問你幾個問題然後推薦幾款酒俾你，都幾特別，好香淳，然後老闆會詳細解釋每一枝酒嘅來歷同埋特點，好正。餐牌上面都有幾種小食但自己帶食物上去都可以，唔洗加錢，幾特別。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
